# Cat Carrier (Siamese) from Cookie in the Deadmines.
# Sources: items.json (Cookie, 15% per kill, pfQuest); the Deadmines (18-23) is in
# Forever; Forever client 1.60.1.70338.

step The Deadmines: Cookie
  tip The Deadmines is a group of five under Moonbrook; the instance portal is inside the Moonbrook mine. Cookie, the murloc cook near the ship at the end, drops the Siamese about 15% of the time in our data.
  goto 38.0,77.5 "The Deadmines portal, inside the Moonbrook mine"
  collect 8490 @38.0,77.5             -- Cookie
